  "notes": [
    "Official AIO Login (change-wp-admin-login) 2.4.1, SHA-256 f025beff401cabc7c4d7c8ee3d549a26197d698e17b5e018ddbabd471b46722b. Native REST writers, authenticated Customizer publish and Permalinks save, fresh-process API readback, provenance, coverage and live schema probing establish this experimental inventory. Production readiness remains unproven.",
    "includes/login-controller/class-login-redirection.php stores string page IDs or custom URL strings at each event target_value, selected by the sibling target_type. The free native save-rule endpoint permits one all_users rule and refuses user/user_role conditions; native updates exercise each ID/URL variant. The generic conditional-json-refs codec owns both representations.",
    "includes/login-customization/class-login-customizer.php registers the authored design controls and synchronizes aio_login_el_* into aio_login_elements_settings. class-login-customization-output-pro-fallback.php:119-173 reads legacy values and overlays each present modern option on every render. Both native authored representations are preserved; rendering needs no generated CSS file or second adapter projection.",
    "The five image selectors resolve attachments through wp_get_attachment_url. Dimension, CSS, toggle, duration, retry and OTP-length values are measured non-reference settings; their numeric values are not entity IDs.",
    "Captcha provider selection, credentials and successful validation are one per-environment authentication configuration. Helper::update_configured_providers_snapshot derives its local cache from those local credentials and Pro social settings. Portable applies do not change that configuration; configure and validate each environment through its native plugin settings.",
    "Login/enumeration tables, OTP challenges, login failures, IP telemetry, phone numbers, 2FA enrollment, Freemius licensing and activation/migration markers remain target local. Paid SMS, magic links, advanced redirect conditions, social login and premium design/Google Fonts are outside the exact free artifact contract.",
    "The namespace declares ownership without classifying unknown future options. A new key must be reviewed explicitly; a blanket prefix exclusion would hide new authored configuration.",
    "aio_login_background_image_mobile is an attachment ID written by the native Customizer image control, not a phone number. Its exact allow_pii exception bypasses only the mobile-name heuristic; the scalar post reference still binds and rewrites the identity."
  ],
  "interpreter": "change-wp-admin-login"
}
